    {
      "id": "206ccb6e0a9860fbec749ba254c2e5d2568349dc",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 403249838,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Hi,\nI think this change is incorrect, if you want to make a patch to one of the asn1 generated files you have to change the source files in epan/dissectors/asn1/gms_map/ in this case.\nSecondly the asn1 definition is:\nMAP-OPERATION\t::=\tCHOICE {\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tlocalValue OperationLocalvalue,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tglobalValue OBJECT IDENTIFIER } \nSo if you have an application sending the map operation as global with a value it's wrongly implemented I think - disclaimer I find it hard to read the code change with git-lab so I may have missed something.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6792385,
            "username": "AndersBroman",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "AndersBroman",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/132fb48f26018ea9516aea909144af3c3a94eaf2ba477efaa9a232abe80d322c?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/AndersBroman"
          },
          "created_at": "2020-08-27T13:42:59.672Z",
          "updated_at": "2020-08-27T13:44:15.121Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 68925296,
